[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4364070014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119162#issuecomment-4364070014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119162","id":4364070014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBB5sfg","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-02T14:52:24Z","updated_at":"2026-05-02T15:03:37Z","body":"I missed all the previous versions and I'm coming in fresh, and I totally don't get why we don't just make the keys editable like values. \r\n\r\nMy main issues with this design are having an edit icon behind the value, because it doesn't imply you can click it to edit the key. Also, after choosing the 'edit key' option, it's very strange you have to toggle back to editing value. It's a sort of opaque state and makes the entire list of properties look strange.\r\n\r\nAnd so I circle back to: why not just make both the key and the value editable like they're two values side by side?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4364070014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4367915209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119162#issuecomment-4367915209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119162","id":4367915209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBFkYyQ","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T02:57:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T02:57:57Z","body":"Okay I'll try to explain to the best of what I remember of when this was tested and what I learned from making it and tweaking this part of the editor.\r\nThere is I think two part to the question:\r\n1. Why don't we make it possible to edit keys all the time\r\n2. Why do we make the value not editable when the key is being edited \r\n\r\n1 :\r\n- You don't edit key very often, hence it doesn't bring that much for it to be always shown\r\n- It would make it easier to reach strange cases of key duplication for example this kind of key change`{A:1,B:2}->{B:1,B:2}->{B:1,A:2}` would be a huge pain to deal with. \r\n- it would need for both editors to be shown at the same time leading to the second part of the question\r\n\r\n\r\n2 :\r\n- having both at the same time create something even less readable \r\n- you need a button each for changing type\r\n- you need more horizontal space which we try to not abuse as some people have small screens\r\n- you lose any capacity to copy paste if you edit both at the same time\r\n\r\nhere is an early try to have both editable at the same time all the time by a plugin creator : \r\n\r\n<img width=\"499\" height=\"485\" alt=\"screen1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15ac9317-e1bf-42d8-873e-fe68f5c7c467\" />\r\n\r\nAll in all I'm clearly against making key always editable but Could be convinced for editing key to make both editable at the same time if someone came up with a good way to show both at the same time that would be readable without needing double the horizontal space.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4367915209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4396805381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119162#issuecomment-4396805381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119162","id":4396805381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBhHtBQ","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T11:44:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T11:45:20Z","body":"> My main issues with this design are having an edit icon behind the value, because it doesn't imply you can click it to edit the key.\r\n\r\nI've just discovered that we have added the inspector context menu to the list of available context menu slot, would placing the edit key there be better. I feel like it would be less discoverable then a button or inside the change type but make more sense. I could also add a copy/paste key when editing value and copy/paste value when editing key but addition of copy/past could wait for another PR.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4396805381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4396862190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119162#issuecomment-4396862190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119162","id":4396862190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBhLK7g","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T11:53:46Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T11:53:46Z","body":"Sorry, I haven't had much time to dive deeper into this, but perhaps we should differentiate the editor between typed and untyped dictionaries. In a typed dictionary without the type dropdown, it may very well be totally fine to show the two input fields side by side? And in untyped, maybe we simply show the key and value in two rows so each input can take up the whole width, and we 'fix' differentiating the items graphically?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4396862190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4877944748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119162#issuecomment-4877944748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119162","id":4877944748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIr-HrA","user":{"login":"Synz